# Docs workflow (SEED Platform)

This repo is the **SEED Platform** (knowledge books + long-term attention).  
`web/` AI catalog and `smartdoc-ai/` are **tools** under that platform — see `docs/00-seed-platform.md`.

When editing specs or Markdown docs:

- Update `docs/00-seed-platform.md` if product positioning changes
- Implementation HOW: `docs/03-implementation.md`
- Gap / standup notes: `docs/02-gap-analysis.md`, `docs/standup.md` when relevant
- Review prompts remain optional helpers under `prompts/`

Do **not** claim the project “only does AI tool search” — that is outdated.
